2. Theory
What is KNN?

K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) is a supervised machine learning algorithm used for classification.

It predicts the class of a new data point by checking its nearest neighboring data points.

In this practical, we predict whether a person has diabetes or not.
Outcome	Meaning
0	No Diabetes
1	Diabetes

